WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.924
After you order, this is how your video
automation gets set up.

2
00:00:04.724 --> 00:00:13.966
It starts with a topic. After you order, you
give us a short brief: the subject, your
audience and the tone. We set the system up
for your brand.

3
00:00:14.766 --> 00:00:20.571
From your topic, the system writes a script.
You can review it before the video is made,
and ask for changes.

4
00:00:21.766 --> 00:00:28.128
Next, the voiceover is recorded from the
script. We choose the voice and language
with you, so it fits your brand.

5
00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:37.055
Then the video is built and edited
automatically, scene by scene, with the
voiceover. It can be a short vertical video,
or a long one.

6
00:00:37.855 --> 00:00:45.703
A cover image is added, and it is placed in
the very first frame of the video. This way
the cover shows up wherever the video is
posted.

7
00:00:46.503 --> 00:00:53.794
You review the finished video, and it is
published with its caption on TikTok,
Instagram or YouTube. We connect your
accounts for you.

8
00:00:54.594 --> 00:00:59.749
Done. Need help? Email
support@ironvisiontools.com.
